1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,763
Verbs like give, send, offer, teach, tell, show and lend take two objects, a person and a thing, so they have two passives.

2
00:00:08,763 --> 00:00:15,208
They gave me a prize: I was given a prize, which English prefers, or a prize was given to me.

3
00:00:15,208 --> 00:00:18,697
He taught the boys English: the boys were taught English.

4
00:00:18,697 --> 00:00:23,489
And buy, make, get and cook take for: a watch was bought for his sister.

